      "npc" : "Suhnbi",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "I can refine all kinds of weapons,",
      "translation" : "各種武器、"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 26,
      "npc" : "Suhnbi",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "armor and equipment, so let me",
      "translation" : "防具和裝備我都能精煉。想精煉什麼，"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 27,
      "npc" : "Suhnbi",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "know what you want to refine.",
      "translation" : "告訴我吧。"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 39,
      "npc" : "Suhnbi",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "[Suhnbi]",
      "translation" : "[順比]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 40,
      "npc" : "Suhnbi",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "I don't think I can refine any items you have...",
      "translation" : "我想我沒法精煉你帶來的任何物品..."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 48,
      "npc" : "Suhnbi",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "[Suhnbi]",
      "translation" : "[順比]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 49,
      "npc" : "Suhnbi",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "Go find another Blacksmith. You can't refine this thing.",
      "translation" : "去找別的鐵匠吧。這東西我精煉不了。"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 53,
      "npc" : "Suhnbi",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "[Suhnbi]",
      "translation" : "[順比]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 54,
      "npc" : "Suhnbi",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "Hmm... someone perfected this already. I don't think I can work on it further.",
      "translation" : "嗯...這件裝備已經精煉到極限了。我想我沒法再處理了。"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 68,
      "npc" : "Suhnbi",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "[Suhnbi]",
      "translation" : "[順比]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
